  "source_text": "Medal of Honor of the National Security Médaille d’honneur de la Sûreté Nationale Medal instituted by decree 74-39 of 26 January 1974. Medal awarded to officers of the National Security Service for 10 years of excellent service. On 29 March 1985, the medal was divided into two classes: second class (for 10 years of service) and first class (for 8 years of service). The original decree from 1974 can be viewed here. The original decree from 1985 can be viewed here. Republic of Tunisia",
